OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day with variable cloud
OL,6,Fand sunny spells for many. The odd
OL,7,Fmist and fog patch is possible
OL,8,Finitially while some hill fog may
OL,9,Flinger over Pennines with the odd spot
OL,10,Fof rain. Light winds. Remaining
OL,11,Frelatively mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,14,Fspells leading to the risk of more
OL,15,Fwidespread mist and fog developing
OL,16,Fovernight. Light winds. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average, but chilly in clearer
OL,18,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
