OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,6,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,7,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Fog likely to return
OL,9,Fovernight. Light winds. Mild by day,
OL,10,Fchilly overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,13,Freasonable day on Saturday once any
OL,14,Ffog clears, turning cloudy with some
OL,15,Flight rain overnight into Sunday.
OL,16,FBecoming dry and partly cloudy into
OL,17,FMonday. Light winds. Temperatures near
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
